rooms_desc ({"Before you is Warlord Slasher's Inner Sanctum. There is a stone dragonguarding his front door. You see its eyes hungrily follow you.                    ___====-_  _-====___              _--^^^#####//      \\\\#####^^^--_           _-^##########// (    ) \\\\##########^-_          -############//  |\\^^/|  \\\\############-        _/############//   (@::@)   \\\\############\\_       /#############((     \\\\//     ))#############\\      -###############\\\\    (oo)    //###############-     -#################\\\\  / ** \\  //#################-    -###################\\\\/      \\//###################-   _#/|##########/\\######(   /\\   )######/\\##########|\\#_   |/ |#/\\#/\\#/\\/  \\#/\\##\\  |  |  /##/\\#/  \\/\\#/\\#/\\#| \\|   '  |/  V  V  '   V  \\#\\| |  | |/#/  V   '  V  V  \\|  '      '   '  '      '   / | |  | | \\   '      '  '   '                       (  | |  | |  )                      __\\ | |  | | /__                     (vvv(VVV)(VVV)vvv)You shiver with fear. It is not too late to go back.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","Standing on the patio you see in the horizon Warlord Slasher's castleunder construction. You can just make out the workers busily doingtheir job. The castle would be a work of art once its finished.                              -|             |-         -|                  [-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-]                  |-         [-_-_-_-_-]          |             |          [-_-_-_-_-]          | o   o |           [  0   0   0  ]     